  2→//! `TensorStore` - Unified Storage Layer for Neumann
  3→//!
  4→//! A thread-safe, sharded key-value store optimized for tensor data:
  5→//! - Dense and sparse vector storage with HNSW indexing
  6→//! - Relational tables with SIMD-accelerated filtering
  7→//! - Graph structures with CSR-optimized traversal
  8→//! - Automatic hot/cold tiering with mmap backing
  9→//!
 10→//! # Architecture
 11→//!
 12→//! ```text
 13→//! TensorStore
 14→//!   +-- SlabRouter (key classification and routing)
 15→//!   |     +-- MetadataSlab (arbitrary key-value)
 16→//!   |     +-- EmbeddingSlab (dense embeddings)
 17→//!   |     +-- RelationalSlab (columnar tables)
 18→//!   |     +-- GraphTensor (nodes and edges)
 19→//!   +-- HNSWIndex (similarity search)
 20→//!   +-- EntityIndex (string <-> ID mapping)
 21→//!   +-- CacheRing (LRU/LFU eviction)
 22→//!   +-- TieredStore (hot/cold storage)
 23→//! ```
 24→//!
 25→//! # Quick Start
 26→//!
 27→//! ```rust
 28→//! use tensor_store::{TensorStore, TensorData, TensorValue, ScalarValue};
 29→//!
 30→//! let store = TensorStore::new();
 31→//!
 32→//! // Store a tensor entity
 33→//! let mut data = TensorData::new();
 34→//! data.set("name", TensorValue::Scalar(ScalarValue::String("example".into())));
 35→//! data.set("embedding", TensorValue::Vector(vec![0.1, 0.2, 0.3]));
 36→//! store.put("entity:1", data).unwrap();
 37→//!
 38→//! // Retrieve it
 39→//! let retrieved = store.get("entity:1").unwrap();
 40→//! assert!(retrieved.has("name"));
 41→//! assert!(retrieved.has("embedding"));
 42→//! ```
 43→//!
 44→//! # Thread Safety
 45→//!
 46→//! All types use `parking_lot` locks (no lock poisoning) and sharded designs
 47→//! for high concurrent throughput. Typical performance:
 48→//! - PUT: ~3.2M ops/sec
 49→//! - GET: ~5M ops/sec
 50→//!
 51→//! # Module Overview
 52→//!
 53→//! | Module | Purpose |
 54→//! |--------|---------|
 55→//! | [`slab_router`] | Key routing and WAL durability |
 56→//! | [`hnsw`] | Hierarchical Navigable Small World index |
 57→//! | [`sparse_vector`] | Memory-efficient sparse embeddings |
 58→//! | [`delta_vector`] | Archetype-based delta compression |
 59→//! | [`relational_slab`] | Column-oriented table storage |
 60→//! | [`graph_tensor`] | CSR graph with BFS/shortest path |
 61→//! | [`cache_ring`] | Fixed-size eviction cache |
 62→//! | [`tiered`] | Hot/cold storage with auto-migration |
 63→//! | [`mmap`] | Memory-mapped cold storage |
 64→//! | [`consistent_hash`] | Partition routing with virtual nodes |
