  2→//! Error types and diagnostics for the Neumann parser.
  3→//!
  4→//! Provides rich error messages with source context, including:
  5→//! - Precise source locations (line and column)
  6→//! - Error context with source snippets
  7→//! - Helpful suggestions and expected tokens
